<title>UK: Commerzbank adds 200 mln marks to COREX bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank adds 200 mln marks to COREX bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following COREX bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 500 million marks from 300 million marks, lead</p>
<p>manager Commerzbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT ** 500 MLN DEM   COUPON     ***	 MATURITY    06.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE   COREX-LINKED  ISS PRICE  100.15    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    FFM	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 28.JAN.97</p>
<p>	  *** FIRST COUPON 4.25 PCT, THEN REX 10-YEAR YIELD</p>
<p>SUBINDEX</p>
<p>		TIMES 68 PERCENT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA-   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
